पावर नहीं: स्पीकर को एम्प्लिफ़ायर चाहिए","zh":"DAC 给出的是电压，而不是功率：喇叭需要放大器"}}],"hints":[{"de":"level × 5.0 / 4095 macht aus einer DAC-Stufe Volt.","en":"level × 5.0 / 4095 turns a DAC level into volts.","es":"nivel × 5,0 / 4095 convierte un nivel del DAC en voltios.","fr":"level × 5.0 / 4095 transforme un niveau du CNA en volts.","hi":"level × 5.0 / 4095, DAC के स्तर को वोल्ट में बदलता है।","zh":"level × 5.0 / 4095 把 DAC 电平换算成伏数。"},{"de":"analogWrite() geht von 8 Bit (0-255) aus, bis analogWriteResolution(12) ihm sagt, dass 4095 der Vollausschlag ist.","en":"analogWrite() assumes 8 bits (0-255) until analogWriteResolution(12) tells it that 4095 is full scale.","es":"analogWrite() supone 8 bits (0-255) hasta que analogWriteResolution(12) le dice que 4095 es el fondo de escala.","fr":"analogWrite() suppose 8 bits (0-255) jusqu'à ce qu'analogWriteResolution(12) lui dise que 4095 est la pleine échelle.","hi":"analogWrite() तब तक 8 बिट (0-255) मानता है जब तक analogWriteResolution(12) उसे न बताए कि 4095 पूरा पैमाना है।","zh":"在 analogWriteResolution(12) 告诉它 4095 是满量程之前，analogWrite() 默认使用 8 位（0-255）。"}],"kind":"lesson","lede":{"de":"Das R4 hat, was das R3 nie hatte: einen 12-Bit-DAC an A0, der eine echte Spannung ausgibt, keine PWM-Impulse. Fahr ihn als Rampe von 0 bis 5 V hoch und gib unterwegs die Stufen aus.","en":"The R4 has what the R3 never had: a 12-bit DAC on A0 that puts out a true voltage, not PWM pulses. Step it from 0 to 5 V as a ramp and print the levels on the way.","es":"La R4 tiene lo que la R3 nunca tuvo: un DAC de 12 bits en A0 que da una tensión de verdad, no pulsos PWM. Súbelo de 0 a 5 V como una rampa e imprime los niveles por el camino.","fr":"Le R4 a ce que le R3 n'a jamais eu : un CNA 12 bits sur A0 qui sort une vraie tension, pas des impulsions PWM. Faites-le monter de 0 à 5 V en rampe et affichez les niveaux en chemin.","hi":"R4 में वह है जो R3 में कभी नहीं था: A0 पर एक 12-बिट DAC, जो PWM पल्स नहीं बल्कि सच्चा वोल्टेज देता है। इसे ढलान की तरह 0 से 5 V तक कदम-दर-कदम चढ़ाएँ और रास्ते के स्तर छापें।","zh":"R4 有 R3 从来没有的东西：A0 上的一个 12 位 DAC，输出真正的电压，而不是 PWM 脉冲。让它像斜坡一样从 0 一步步升到 5 V，并在途中打印电平。"},"legacyFigure":{"circuit":"dac-wave","page":"/figures/boards/uno-r4.html","sheets":["board","breadboard","schematic","power"]},"level":"analog","order":4,"pins":[{"color":"purple","pin":"A0","role":{"de":"DAC-Ausgang: 0 bis etwa 5 V.","en":"DAC output: 0 to about 5 V.","es":"Salida del DAC: de 0 a unos 5 V.","fr":"Sortie du CNA : 0 à environ 5 V.","hi":"DAC आउटपुट: 0 से लगभग 5 V।","zh":"DAC 输出：0 到约 5 V。"},"to":{"de":"Eine Steckbrücke zum Steckbrett, wo ein Messgerät oder ein Oszilloskop messen kann","en":"A jumper to the breadboard, where a meter or a scope can probe it","es":"Un cable a la protoboard, donde un multímetro o un osciloscopio puede medirlo","fr":"Un fil de liaison vers la platine d'essai, où un multimètre ou un oscilloscope peut la mesurer","hi":"ब्रेडबोर्ड तक एक जंपर, जहाँ मीटर या स्कोप इसे जाँच सके","zh":"一根跳线接到面包板上，万用表或示波器可以在那里测量"}}],"quizzes":[{"id":"dac-wave-quiz","questions":[{"answer":1,"id":"q1","options":[{"de":"Mehr Strom","en":"More current","es":"Más corriente","fr":"Plus de courant","hi":"ज़्यादा करंट","zh":"更大的电流"},{"de":"Eine gleichmäßige Spannung irgendwo zwischen 0 und 5 V","en":"A steady voltage anywhere between 0 and 5 V","es":"Una tensión estable en cualquier punto entre 0 y 5 V","fr":"Une tension stable n'importe où entre 0 et 5 V","hi":"0 और 5 V के बीच कहीं भी एक स्थिर वोल्टेज","zh":"0 到 5 V 之间任意位置的稳定电压"},{"de":"Schnelleres Blinken","en":"A faster blink","es":"Un parpadeo más rápido","fr":"Un clignotement plus rapide","hi":"तेज़ ब्लिंक","zh":"更快的闪烁"}],"q":{"de":"Was liefert dir der DAC, was PWM nicht kann?","en":"What does the DAC give you that PWM doesn't?","es":"¿Qué te da el DAC que no te da el PWM?","fr":"Que vous donne le CNA que le PWM ne donne pas ?","hi":"DAC आपको ऐसा क्या देता है जो PWM नहीं देता?","zh":"DAC 能给你什么 PWM 给不了的东西？"},"why":{"de":"PWM schaltet zwischen 0 und 5 V und erreicht die Stufe nur im Mittel; der DAC hält eine echte Spannung an A0.","en":"PWM switches between 0 and 5 V and only averages to the level; the DAC holds a true voltage on A0.","es":"El PWM conmuta entre 0 y 5 V y solo llega al nivel en promedio; el DAC mantiene una tensión de verdad en A0.","fr":"Le PWM bascule entre 0 et 5 V et n'atteint le niveau qu'en moyenne ; le CNA tient une vraie tension sur A0.","hi":"PWM, 0 और 5 V के बीच स्विच करता है और सिर्फ़ औसत में उस स्तर पर पहुँचता है; DAC, A0 पर सच्चा वोल्टेज बनाए रखता है।","zh":"PWM 在 0 和 5 V 之间切换，只是平均下来等于那个电平；DAC 则在 A0 上保持一个真正的电压。"}},{"answer":2,"id":"q2","options":[{"de":"127","en":"127","es":"127","fr":"127","hi":"127","zh":"127"},{"de":"1023","en":"1023","es":"1023","fr":"1023","hi":"1023","zh":"1023"},{"de":"2048","en":"2048","es":"2048","fr":"2048","hi":"2048","zh":"2048"}],"q":{"de":"Welche Stufe ergibt mit analogWriteResolution(12) etwa 2,5 V?","en":"With analogWriteResolution(12), which level gives about 2.5 V?","es":"Con analogWriteResolution(12), ¿qué nivel da unos 2,5 V?","fr":"Avec analogWriteResolution(12), quel niveau donne environ 2,5 V ?","hi":"analogWriteResolution(12) के साथ कौन-सा स्तर लगभग 2.5 V देता है?","zh":"使用 analogWriteResolution(12) 时，哪个电平能给出约 2.5 V？"},"why":{"de":"4095 ist der Vollausschlag (5 V), also liegt die Hälfte bei etwa 2048.","en":"4095 is full scale (5 V), so half way is about 2048.","es":"4095 es el fondo de escala (5 V), así que la mitad es más o menos 2048.","fr":"4095 est la pleine échelle (5 V) : la moitié vaut donc environ 2048.","hi":"4095 पूरा पैमाना (5 V) है, इसलिए आधा रास्ता लगभग 2048 है।","zh":"4095 是满量程（5 V），所以一半大约是 2048。"}},{"answer":0,"id":"q3","options":[{"de":"A0","en":"A0","es":"A0","fr":"A0","hi":"A0","zh":"A0"},{"de":"D9","en":"D9","es":"D9","fr":"D9","hi":"D9","zh":"D9"},{"de":"A5","en":"A5","es":"A5","fr":"A5","hi":"A5","zh":"A5"}],"q":{"de":"An welchem Pin liegt der DAC?","en":"Which pin is the DAC on?","es":"¿En qué pin está el DAC?","fr":"Sur quelle broche est le CNA ?","hi":"DAC किस पिन पर है?","zh":"DAC 在哪个引脚上？"},"why":{"de":"Der DAC-Ausgang des RA4M1 ist P014, der Pin A0; DAC ist ein anderer Name dafür.","en":"The RA4M1's DAC output is P014, the A0 pin; DAC is another name for it.","es":"La salida del DAC del RA4M1 es P014, el pin A0; DAC es otro nombre para él.","fr":"La sortie du CNA du RA4M1 est P014, la broche A0 ; DAC est un autre nom pour elle.","hi":"RA4M1 का DAC आउटपुट P014 है, यानी A0 पिन; DAC उसी का दूसरा नाम है।","zh":"RA4M1 的 DAC 输出是 P014，也就是 A0 引脚；DAC 是它的另一个名字。"}}]}],"serialSample":{"baud":115200,"lines":["DAC 0 = 0.00 V","DAC 1040 = 1.27 V"]},"specs":[{"label":{"de":"DAC","en":"DAC","es":"DAC","fr":"CNA","hi":"DAC","zh":"DAC"},"value":{"de":"12 Bit an A0: Stufen 0-4095","en":"12 bits on A0: levels 0-4095","es":"12 bits en A0: niveles 0-4095","fr":"12 bits sur A0 : niveaux 0-4095","hi":"A0 पर 12 बिट: स्तर 0-4095","zh":"A0 上 12 位：电平 0-4095"}},{"label":{"de":"Ein Schritt","en":"One step","es":"Un paso","fr":"Un pas","hi":"एक कदम","zh":"一步"},"value":{"de":"5 V ÷ 4095 ≈ 1,2 mV","en":"5 V ÷ 4095 ≈ 1.2 mV","es":"5 V ÷ 4095 ≈ 1,2 mV","fr":"5 V ÷ 4095 ≈ 1,2 mV","hi":"5 V ÷ 4095 ≈ 1.2 mV","zh":"5 V ÷ 4095 ≈ 1.2 mV"}}],"starter":{"source":"src_sketch","splices":{"steps":{"16":"16","256":"256","64":"64"}},"template":"// A ramp on the DAC: A0 climbs from 0 to 5 V, again and again\nconst int STEPS = {{p:steps}};\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  analogWriteResolution(12);       // 12 bits: levels 0-4095\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  for (int i = 0; i < STEPS; i++) {\n    int level = (long)i * 4095 / (STEPS - 1);\n    analogWrite(DAC, level);       // DAC is another name for A0\n    delay(10);\n    if (i % (STEPS / 4) == 0) {\n      Serial.print(\"DAC \");\n      Serial.print(level);\n      Serial.print(\" = \");\n      Serial.print(level * 5.0 / 4095, 2);\n      Serial.println(\" V\");\n    }\n  }\n}\n"},"steps":[{"de":"Drück auf „Ausführen“: Der DAC steigt von 0 auf 5 V und beginnt von vorn, und der serielle 